WEBVTT

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:31.482
ME: I went onstage and said,

00:01:31.506 --> 00:01:32.978
"I'm super anxious right now.

00:01:33.002 --> 00:01:34.798
And I've been told that last year,

00:01:34.822 --> 00:01:36.866
you got impatient with the speaker.

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:39.874
And some of you picked up
the bread roll and threw it."

00:01:39.898 --> 00:01:41.751
AG: (Laughs)

00:01:41.775 --> 00:01:44.276
ME: "In fact, I'm not just
anxious, I'm scared."

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:47.626
AG: In that moment,
Mohamed didn't hide his insecurities.

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:49.136
He admitted them out loud,

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:51.547
sharing his real feelings
with the audience.

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:54.200
When you're nervous
about a big performance,

00:01:54.224 --> 00:01:56.486
whether it's a speech or a job interview,

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:59.144
people often say, "Just be yourself."

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:00.956
It's practically gospel